}

### Create public catalogue category before a sibling
# @prompt catalogueParentCategoryId Existing parent category id
# @prompt beforeCatalogueCategoryId Existing sibling id
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/catalogue/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogueWriteToken.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": {{catalogueParentCategoryId}},
  "beforeId": {{beforeCatalogueCategoryId}},
  "name": "Local Ranked Category",
  "slug": "local-ranked-category",
  "active": true
}

### Replace category
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/catalogue/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogueWriteToken.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": null,
  "name": "Local Test Category Updated",
  "slug": "local-test-category",
